ok  bunkerd/rollback  1.022s

$ go test -v -count=1 ./...
--- PASS: TestSharedContextNoopsLaterSteps          (reproduced: userdel refused, residue survives)
--- PASS: TestBudgetAttemptsUserdelAfterAnchorSpent  (userdel runs after anchor spent)
